#: ../../library/blueprints/appBlueprints.rst:9
msgid ""
"App Blueprints support a vast array of providers and configurations with "
"programmatic markup or Infrastructure as Code capabilities. Blueprints "
"configs can be manually added or scoped to a git repo. |morpheus| "
"blueprints allows for full automation configuration, locked fields, "
"tiered boots, and linked tiers with exported evars. All blueprints have "
"permission settings for controlling group and tenant access."
